  m_Name: Youtubers
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  id: carta_003
  titulo: YouTube Business Deal
  arteCarta: {fileID: -4738230909173435629, guid: 39e6614c3966f4c4592ef2aa87fdfd1d, type: 3}
  descricao: Ronald and Brendan run an urban exploration channel, but the revenue
    isn't enough to make ends meet. A cigarette company wants to sponsor the channel.
    Do you agree to invest as well?
  contratar:
    textoResultado: The duo signs a contract with the cigarette company and your
      company. During every livestream, one of the hosts is required to appear smoking.
      The partnership works for a while, until one day, during an exploration, they
      enter a house with a gas leak. A cigarette butt causes an explosion that kills
      them both, also destroying the reputation of both sponsoring companies.
    deltaDinheiro: -250
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
  naoContratar:
    textoResultado: The duo signs a contract only with the cigarette company. During
      every livestream, one of the hosts is required to appear smoking. The partnership
      works for a while, until one day, during an exploration, they enter a house
      with a gas leak. A cigarette butt causes an explosion that kills them both,
      completely destroying the reputation of the sponsoring company. Since you chose
      not to participate, your reputation remains intact.
    deltaDinheiro: 0
    arteResultado: {fileID: 0}
